  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 5.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="5.1" corresp="#wit-q">Unde uisum est sapientibus omnibus, quod isti tres homines unius rectitudinis essent digni.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="5.1" corresp="#wit-q">Unde visum est sapientibus omnibus, quod isti tres homines unius rectitudinis essent digni.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q">It has therefore been determined by the whole council that these three [classes of] men shall incur the same punishment.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Daher dünkte allen Witan richtig, dass diese drei [Arten] Menschen derselben Rechtsstrafe theilhaft würden.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Therefore it seemed right to all the witan that these three [kinds of] people should be subject to the same legal penalty.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
